{"seq":2,"slug":"appointment-slot-stair-elevator","title":"预约时段与楼梯/电梯/入户限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/two-man-delivery-scheduling/appointment-slot-stair-elevator","wordCount":2069,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"预约时段与楼梯-电梯-入户限制\">预约时段与楼梯/电梯/入户限制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这一篇处理大件派送里最容易做错的环节：把「什么时候到」和「进不进得去」这两件看似无关的事，统一成<strong>可达性档案 + 时段库存</strong>两个数据模型。</p>\n<p>先说一个事实层面的背景。大件派送的客户体验敏感点全部集中在最后一次上门，而这一段的成本在物流总成本中的占比异常高——行业通行的说法是最后一公里可占整体配送成本的一半以上（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Last_mile_(transportation)\">Last mile 词条引用的成本占比</a>）。之所以这么高，是因为它是唯一一段「每一单都要单独发生、无法批量摊薄」的作业：一次上门对应一个地址、一段时间、一组人。因此任何减少上门次数或提高一次成功率的设计，都是在直接压缩成本；而可达性判定做错，就是白跑一次。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Booking[客户下单] --&gt; Slot[选择预约时段]&#10;  Slot --&gt; Hold[时段临时预占]&#10;  Hold --&gt; Access[可达性档案收集]&#10;  Access --&gt; Judged{可达性判定}&#10;  Judged --&gt;|可达| Confirm[确认预约 + 附加费]&#10;  Judged --&gt;|条件可达| Note[标注作业方式: 拆件/爬楼机/吊装]&#10;  Judged --&gt;|不可达| Rework[改约/改配送方式/取消]&#10;  Confirm --&gt; Dispatch[进入派单池]&#10;  Note --&gt; Dispatch\">graph TD\n  Booking[客户下单] --&gt; Slot[选择预约时段]\n  Slot --&gt; Hold[时段临时预占]\n  Hold --&gt; Access[可达性档案收集]\n  Access --&gt; Judged{可达性判定}\n  Judged --&gt;|可达| Confirm[确认预约 + 附加费]\n  Judged --&gt;|条件可达| Note[标注作业方式: 拆件/爬楼机/吊装]\n  Judged --&gt;|不可达| Rework[改约/改配送方式/取消]\n  Confirm --&gt; Dispatch[进入派单池]\n  Note --&gt; Dispatch</pre><h2 id=\"可达性档案的字段设计\">可达性档案的字段设计</h2><h3 id=\"为什么不能靠客户描述\">为什么不能靠客户描述</h3><p>客户在备注里写「三楼，有点窄」，这句话对人可读，对系统不可判定。可达性必须是一组枚举化的字段，具备三个性质：<strong>可判定</strong>（能直接算真值）、<strong>可采集</strong>（客户或系统能填出来）、<strong>可举证</strong>（事后争议时能回看当时依据）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>取值</th>\n<th>采集来源</th>\n<th>判定用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>elevator_present</code></td>\n<td>yes / no / unknown</td>\n<td>客户填写、地址库</td>\n<td>决定是否走楼梯链路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>elevator_car_depth_cm</code></td>\n<td>数值</td>\n<td>客户填写或现场测</td>\n<td>与最长包件比对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>elevator_door_width_cm</code></td>\n<td>数值</td>\n<td>客户填写</td>\n<td>与包件截面比对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>elevator_rated_load_kg</code></td>\n<td>数值</td>\n<td>客户填写</td>\n<td>人与货同乘的总重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>elevator_goods_allowed</code></td>\n<td>yes / no / unknown</td>\n<td>客户或物业</td>\n<td>部分住宅电梯禁止运货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>floor_level</code></td>\n<td>整数（含地下）</td>\n<td>地址库</td>\n<td>楼梯段数推算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>stairs_flight_count</code></td>\n<td>整数</td>\n<td>客户填写</td>\n<td>作业时长与费用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>stair_turn_width_cm</code></td>\n<td>数值</td>\n<td>客户填写</td>\n<td>长件转角通过性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>door_clear_width_cm</code></td>\n<td>数值</td>\n<td>客户填写</td>\n<td>入户门通过性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>truck_access_allowed</code></td>\n<td>yes / no / time_window</td>\n<td>客户或物业</td>\n<td>小区能否进货车</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>parking_distance_m</code></td>\n<td>数值</td>\n<td>地图估算</td>\n<td>搬运距离与时长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>source</code> / <code>captured_at</code></td>\n<td>元数据</td>\n<td>系统</td>\n<td>有效期与可信度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"字段的失败模式\">字段的失败模式</h3><p>这张表的设计难点不在字段本身，而在它的三种失败模式，每一种都要有对策：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>字段缺失</strong>：客户不填。对策是把「不填」当作一个独立状态（<code>unknown</code>）而不是默认值，并对 <code>unknown</code> 走保守判定——按最坏情况预估作业时长与费用，同时在派单前用电话或短信补齐关键项。用默认值填充缺失字段是最危险的反模式，因为它把不确定性静默地变成了错误的确定性。</li>\n<li><strong>字段错误</strong>：客户填错（把电梯门宽填成轿厢宽）。对策是<strong>交叉校验</strong>：电梯载重与轿厢尺寸的组合、楼层与电梯存在性的组合，都会出现物理上不合理的组合，应当拦截并要求复核。</li>\n<li><strong>字段过期</strong>：小区改造、电梯停运。对策是给档案一个<strong>有效期</strong>，并对同一地址的重复订单优先复用最近一次<strong>派人核实过</strong>的记录（<code>verified</code> 标志），而不是一直沿用客户首次填写值。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE access_profile (&#10;  profile_id       UUID PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  address_hash     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  elevator_present TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (elevator_present IN (&#39;yes&#39;,&#39;no&#39;,&#39;unknown&#39;)),&#10;  elevator_car_depth_cm    INTEGER,&#10;  elevator_door_width_cm   INTEGER,&#10;  elevator_rated_load_kg   NUMERIC(6,1),&#10;  elevator_goods_allowed   TEXT CHECK (elevator_goods_allowed IN (&#39;yes&#39;,&#39;no&#39;,&#39;unknown&#39;)),&#10;  floor_level      INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;  stairs_flight_count      INTEGER,&#10;  stair_turn_width_cm      INTEGER,&#10;  door_clear_width_cm      INTEGER,&#10;  truck_access_allowed     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  parking_distance_m       INTEGER,&#10;  confidence       TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (confidence IN (&#39;customer_stated&#39;,&#39;verified&#39;,&#39;estimated&#39;)),&#10;  captured_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_until      TIMESTAMPTZ&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> access_profile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  profile_id       UUID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  address_hash     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  elevator_present </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (elevator_present </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'yes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unknown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  elevator_car_depth_cm    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  elevator_door_width_cm   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  elevator_rated_load_kg   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  elevator_goods_allowed   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (elevator_goods_allowed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'yes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'no'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unknown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  floor_level      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stairs_flight_count      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stair_turn_width_cm      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  door_clear_width_cm      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  truck_access_allowed     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  parking_distance_m       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confidence       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (confidence </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'customer_stated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'verified'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'estimated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  captured_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_until      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>confidence</code> 字段是整套模型的关键。它让下游判定可以按可信度分级处理：<code>verified</code> 直接用于最终判费，<code>customer_stated</code> 用于预估并在派送前复核，<code>estimated</code> 只用于时长估算。抛掉这个字段，系统就只能一视同仁，必然在精度与效率之间二选一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"通过性判定\">通过性判定</h3><p>有了字段，判定就是一组比较。以电梯链路为例，一件货要能被电梯运送，需同时满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∧</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∧</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{car\\_depth} &gt; l_{package\\_max} \\quad \\wedge \\quad w_{door} &gt; w_{package\\_max} \\quad \\wedge \\quad L_{rated} &gt; w_{package} + 2 \\cdot w_{person}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0614em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0614em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: